# Where the LD Test Panel, its Test Store and their loader come from. opengwasdb builds and
# regenerates them (its scripts/ld/make_test_panel.py and make_test_store.py); ogquery holds a
# copy, read only, as it holds tests/contract. Each `file` line is one file of that commit, byte
# for byte, at the same path in both repositories: its git blob id there, and its path.
# tests/ld/test_source.py holds every file listed to its blob id, and every file under
# tests/ld/data/ to a line. opengwasdb's Test Panel also holds the genotypes, PC File and dosages
# (panel.pgen, .psam, .keep, pcs.eigenvec, dosages.raw); its build tests read them, these do not.
# Refresh by copying the same paths from a later opengwasdb commit and rewriting the lines from
# `git ls-tree -r <commit> tests/ld/data tests/ld/testdata.py` there.
